# autotrim_learn.scn — validate the ALWAYS-ON onboard trim learner
# 常時オンボード・トリム学習器の検証
#
# Start with trim=0 (default), apply a steady CROSS wind, and hover for a LONG
# time. The onboard learner (pid_controller::learnTrim) should integrate the
# downwind drift into the matching trim axis with time constant ~20 s, so the
# drift RATE decreases over the hover and the craft self-trims — WITHOUT any param
# override (the learner does it on its own). Compare the drift rate early vs late.
#
# 2026-09-19: the SILS start attitude was corrected to level-and-NORTH (it used to
# be the MuJoCo identity quaternion, level but facing EAST because MuJoCo's world
# is ENU), matching the firmware's yaw=0 boot state. Body forward at yaw=0 is now
# NORTH (NED +x), so the fy (east) wind below is a CROSS wind acting on ROLL, and
# the drift to watch is truth.csv's pos_y. Re-point the wind to fx for a
# pitch-axis test.
# 2026-09-19: SILS の初期姿勢を「水平かつ北向き」に修正した（以前は MuJoCo の単位
# クォータニオン＝水平だが東向き。MuJoCo の世界が ENU のため）。yaw=0 での機体前方は
# 北（NED +x）になったので、下の fy（東）の風は roll に効く横風であり、見るべき
# ドリフトは truth.csv の pos_y である。pitch 軸を見たいなら風を fx へ振り直す。
#
# trim=0(既定)・機体前方軸の定常向かい風・長いホバーで開始。オンボード学習器
# (pid_controller::learnTrim)が風下ドリフトを時定数~20sで pitch_trim_ に積分→ドリフト
# 速度がホバー中に減衰し自己トリムする(param上書きなし)。px ドリフト速度を前半/後半で比較。
#
# Run: sf sils scenario simulator/sils/scenarios/autotrim_learn.scn --target vehicle --duration 110000000
#
#  <t>  ch    <thr> <roll> <pitch> <yaw> <arm> <hold_ms> <rate_hz> <alt>
   0    wind  0.0   0.008  0.0                                          # steady NED-east wind (body forward at yaw=0)
   0    rc    2048  2048   2048    2048  0     13000     50              # A: disarmed 13 s
   +    rc    2048  2048   2048    2048  1     1000      50              # B: ARM
   +    rc    3106  2048   2048    2048  1     2600      50              # C: STABILIZE gentle take-off (trim=0, clean climb)
   +    rc    2048  2048   2048    2048  1     90000     50        1      # D: ALT_HOLD hover 90 s — learner integrates drift -> pitch_trim_
   +    rc    2048  2048   2048    2048  1     2000      50        1      # E: settle 2 s
